// chriz-iwd-encounters 320: the orog raid on Kuldahar, on top of %cie_kul_copy%, the
// %cie_kul_who%' copy of the raid's "stand still until the party comes close"
// script (%cie_kul_sleep%): they also wake when %cie_kul_wake_reason%.

IF
  %cie_kul_wake%
  !Global("CREATURE_STATE_VARBit6","LOCALS",1)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CREATURE_STATE_VARBit6","LOCALS",1)
    ChangeAIScript("%cie_kul_awake%",GENERAL)
END
